    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9308" root="حنش" body-key="H">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنَشَ</span></b> , (S, A, Msb, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنِشَ</span></b> , (Msb, K,)
<i>He hunted, sought to catch</i> or <i>capture,</i> or <i>caught</i>
or <i>captured,</i> (S, A, Msb, K,) such animals as are
hunted &amp;c., (S, Msb, K,) or such as are termed
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْنَاش</span>, pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنَشٌ</span>; (A;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احنش</span></b> . (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنَشَتْهُ الحَيَّةُ</span> <i>The serpent bit him.</i> (A, TA.)

